path_review = "Traced native REST routing and archive fallbacks, block notifier through Phoenix to browser cache, multichain context through entities and raw links, advanced-filter serialization, flashblock recovery, interchain row identity and EVM-only local-node history restart/recovery. No extra qualification commands were executed."

